      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "To assess the impact of DA to physiotherapy on general practice for adult MSDs. The primary outcome was GP workload (number/frequency of consultations). Secondary outcomes were prescriptions (medications, imaging), clinical outcomes (pain, function, quality of life), direct/ indirect costs, interprofessional collaboration, GP satisfaction/perceptions, and adverse events.",
